# SECRETS.md

This file is gitignored. Keep a copy in your password manager.

## Production secrets (Railway)

| Variable | Used by | Source | Rotation | Last rotated |
|----------|---------|--------|----------|--------------|
| DATABASE_URL | backend | Railway Postgres plugin | as-needed | YYYY-MM-DD |
| SENTRY_DSN | backend | sentry.io/settings/projects/<project>/keys/ | annually | YYYY-MM-DD |
| VITE_SENTRY_DSN | frontend | sentry.io (separate frontend project) | annually | YYYY-MM-DD |
| S3_ACCESS_KEY | backend | <provider> dashboard | quarterly | YYYY-MM-DD |
| S3_SECRET_KEY | backend | <provider> dashboard | quarterly | YYYY-MM-DD |

## Monitoring

| Service | URL | Purpose |
|---------|-----|---------|
| BetterStack | https://uptime.betterstack.com/... | /health every 60s |
| Sentry | https://sentry.io/organizations/.../issues/ | error tracking |

## Recovery

If credentials leak:
1. Rotate at source
2. Update Railway: `railway variables --set KEY=newvalue`
3. Update local `.env`
4. Update this table
